§5§lAbyss Walkers\n\n\
§0Endermen are remarkably tall creatures, though very little is known about their physiology. \
They possess strength uncharacteristic of their spindly nature. \
They are capable of teleportation—"
data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
—on a whim, seemingly without any regard for—\
distance or obstacles. This makes them exceptionally difficult to corner.An Enderman's \
strikes are powerful enough to overwhelm a shield, leaving its wielder briefly defenseless. \
Keeping one's guard up is therefore not always—"
data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
—sufficient protection. Even more concerning is their ability to extend their teleportation to others. \
Cover offers little safety against an angered Enderman, as it can simply pull \
its targets from behind walls and obstacles. Water appears to be a very effective deterrent."